`data/records/`."},{"line":50,"matchedTerms":["search console"],"text":"\nThe cycle is the shared `@emsenn/content-production/content-farm` engine, with Koios declared as an instance config: seed terms, beat sources, Search Console property, front-matter namespace, voice, model, gates, content store, and data store.\nDemand folds seed terms, earned views, Search Console material from `data/records/search-console.json` when present, and coverage decay.\nRuns append to `data/logs/mill-runs.jsonl`; records live under `data/records/`.\n"}],"score":26,"projectionMatchedTerms":["three"]},{"path":"/home/emsenn/info/lib/emsenn/services/561-group/services/rsc-quiescent/services/koios-news/sites/koios.news/content/posts/hello-world.md","relativeToRoot":"sites/koios.news/content/posts/hello-world.md","digest":"sha256:8e09ea2292deb107d3ca11d068a296ac5727551b101a3fe0c876140f4962c8a7","byteSize":9884,"excerptTruncated":false,"owner":{"nodeId":null,"root":"/home/emsenn/info/lib/emsenn/services/561-group/services/rsc-quiescent/services/koios-news","package":null},"status":"current","matchedTerms":["content mill"],"snippets":[{"line":7,"matchedTerms":["content mill"],"text":"author: \"Nik Koios\"\nslug: \"hello-world\"\ndescription: \"Koios.News is a collapse-aware autonomous news site: a newsroom, content mill, standards system, and public web publication learning to report through facts.\"\nsummary: \"Koios.News is an autonomous, collapse-aware news publication. It reads climate, technology, politics, and the economy as one compounding system, then turns sourced evidence into articles, feeds, fingerprints, and operator-visible newsroom work.\"\nkeywords: [\"Koios.News\"]"},{"line":45,"matchedTerms":["content mill"],"text":"---\nKoios.\nNews is now here as a public experiment in autonomous journalism: a collapse-aware newsroom, a standards system, a content mill, and a website that tries to make its own work visible instead of hiding the machinery behind a smooth front page.\nThis is the hello-world article because every strange machine needs one plain sentence at the beginning.\nThe sentence is this: Koios."}],"score":17,"projectionMatchedTerms":["technology"]}]},"contextualBundleDigest":"sha256:785e25d0bc9a2422a279771823126d88cbdc6d4719fdab0e15030526f9c5564f","gapBundle":{"type":"GapBundle","sourceRecoveryGapBundleDigest":"sha256:1a91f4a07478585b156b5e41f44c35b9e5008f0d51d0e4b8da2f5adf954140e5","gapCount":5,"gaps":[{"type":"unmatched-term","term":"java three hotfix away dying horribly"},{"type":"unmatched-term","term":"hotfix"},{"type":"unmatched-term","term":"dying"},{"type":"unmatched-term","term":"horribly"},{"type":"candidate-truncation","matched":17,"admitted":8,"omitted":9}]},"gapBundleDigest":"sha256:a493c8a5ed0852cb5b16563d342c886b5d4c8176d823f2a4f827be68a30b7d81","filesystemReads":0,"providerResultDigest":"sha256:38d6e35a1d269861863cf50daf1691d4dc0fada8f1bdae08e5df758452fb4d53"}}]

